# Languages

- Ship English and Tamil together. Put interface copy in `messages/en.json` and `messages/ta.json`.
- Keep the same page when the language changes, including the query string.
- Set `<html lang>` and give the language switcher accessible names.
- Use a Tamil-capable font for Tamil pages.
- Mark sample Tamil product and guide copy as unverified until the owner reviews it.

```tsx
<Link href={href} locale="ta" hrefLang="ta" lang="ta">தமிழ்</Link>
```
